# ponytail: STT_server/data/ used to be excluded here ("NUNCA commitear")
# to keep credential hashes out of the public repo, but that was over-
# protective and bit us in prod: the deployed container had no users.json,
# so login returned 401 for EVERYONE (the auth code calls load_users(),
# gets [], no user matches).
#
# The hashes are already public in db/migrations/002_seed_admin.sql, so
# excluding the data dir buys zero extra security. We ship it with the
# image now. Future hardening: move the user store to Postgres and drop
# the JSON files entirely.
# STT_server/data/
